  "nvr must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and HTTP (TCP 80) from backup.",
  "Allow nvr to connect to backup using RDP (TCP 3389) and SNMP (UDP 161) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Block PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306), RDP (TCP 3389) from ntp-servers to dmz-web; the rest of TCP ports 1024-65535 between them is allowed.",
  "ntp-servers is isolated: it may only reach dmz-web on HTTPS (TCP 443); dev-lab on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in dmz-web may reach backup over syslog (UDP 514) and RDP (TCP 3389).",
  "Deny all traffic from nvr to dmz-web (this overrides any public service).",
  "Hosts in backup may reach nvr over SMB (TCP 445) and HTTP (TCP 80) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Hosts in backup may reach dmz-web over SNMP (UDP 161)."
